# Elder Bough Walk-on: a little leaf sprite wearing an acorn cap.
# Gold, so it stands out from the green field and the red defenders. The cap
# is narrower than the body, so the gold still shows from the game's steep camera.
size 5 7 4
voxel 0.13
mirror x
colors
  c acornCap
  s acornStem
  g leafGold
  d leafGoldDark
  k ink
  b barkDark
slice 0
  ...
  ...
  .cc
  gkg
  ggg
  dgg
  .b.
slice 1-2
  ..s
  .cc
  .cc
  ggg
  ggg
  ggg
  .b.
slice 3
  ...
  ...
  .cc
  ggg
  ggg
  ggg
  ...
